sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Client App
    participant SessGW as Session Gateway
    participant SessCtrl as Session Controller
    participant Orch as Orchestrator Service
    participant SessRepo as Session Repository
    participant TurnRepo as Turn Repository
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    User->>Client: Start simulation
    Client->>SessGW: POST /sessions
    SessGW->>SessCtrl: createSession()
    SessCtrl->>Orch: initSession()
    Orch->>SessRepo: insert(session)
    SessRepo->>PG: INSERT sessions
    Orch-->>SessCtrl: sessionId
    SessCtrl-->>SessGW: 201 sessionId
    SessGW-->>Client: sessionId

    Note over Client: First turn
    Client->>SessGW: POST /sessions/:id/turns
    SessGW->>SessCtrl: createTurn()
    SessCtrl->>Orch: startTurn(sessionId)
    Orch->>TurnRepo: insert(turn)
    TurnRepo->>PG: INSERT turns
    Orch-->>SessCtrl: turnId
    SessCtrl-->>SessGW: 201 turnId
    SessGW-->>Client: turnId

    Orch-->>Redis: cache session context
    Orch-->>MQ: publish simulation.started
